Z||000000||Yellow88GT||04-06-2001||03:25 PM||||This may be old news, but here it goes.....<P>I was looking at the shot of the '89 GT that jjp777 has on his web site. I was thinking "man that door outline sure looks like an 84 to 88 Fiero's"<BR>So I copied it and added a shot of my GT over it this is what I ended up with.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/together.jpg"> <P>Not only is the door the same, but the wheel base, and the windsheild. It looks like GM was just updating the body panels, etc. for 89.<P>Now the question is, Would anyone pay for a body upgrade kit for an '89 body?<P>I think I would, I like that 89 alot.<P>Sorry if this is old news, I'm new to the forum.<P>Jerry||||reg||1
